# Shell scripts must stay LF on every platform so Git Bash (Windows) can run
# them — CRLF breaks the `#!/usr/bin/env bash` shebang. This protects the
# template's agent hooks (lazurite/templates/default/tools/lazuli-hooks/*.sh),
# which are embedded verbatim into every scaffolded project, plus the repo's
# own scripts/*.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
